window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/security-v27-070-a9c21f6326e7c4a6.json"]={sha256:"a9c21f6326e7c4a6c0e0e0cb824afd7c298aeb83df13989978e47fdf0aa9948f",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-b10ac85beeea7332","url":"https://www.itl.nist.gov/div898/handbook/prc/section2/prc241.htm","title":"NIST/SEMATECH: confidence limits for a proportion","titleEn":"NIST/SEMATECH: confidence limits for a proportion","publisher":"NIST","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-070","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-070","related":[{"id":"security-v27-071","referenceUrls":["https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc3339"],"title":"RFC 3339：跨主機時間不確定區間與可證明先後","titleEn":"RFC 3339: cross-host uncertainty intervals and provable event order","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付20及200筆結果、公式重算、獨立性聲明和重複資料反例；不推論未抽樣的攻擊或環境。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver both outcome tables, formula checks, independence assumptions and duplicated-data counterexamples, without extrapolating to unsampled attacks or environments.","difference":"建立同一UTC原點的秒值、來源精度、偏移界限及事件區間；僅在兩區間不重疊時產生確定先後的有向邊。","differenceEn":"Build seconds relative to one UTC origin, source precision, offset bounds and event intervals. Emit a definite precedence edge only when the corresponding uncertainty intervals do not overlap.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["使用雙側95%Wilson區間下端，z=1.96；獨立同分布假設若不成立，不能把重複樣本當更多資訊。 本課所有數值、事件與系統狀態均為原創合成資料；只在本機檔案與授權隔離練習中處理，不接觸生產設備或他人資料。 基準20次獨立合成測試成功18次，p̂=0.9；改變樣本為200次成功180次，比例相同。 下端=[p̂+z²/(2n)−z√(p̂(1−p̂)/n+z²/(4n²))]/[1+z²/n]；n=20得到69.896179%。","RFC 3339規範時間表示；此課的有界時鐘誤差模型是教學假設。字串轉UTC不會消除時鐘偏移，排序結果也不是因果證明。 本課所有數值、事件與系統狀態均為原創合成資料；只在本機檔案與授權隔離練習中處理，不接觸生產設備或他人資料。 A事件名義100秒、界限±2秒；B名義107秒、界限±3秒。輸入CSV保留raw_time、normalized_time、bound、clock_source與原始列雜湊。 A最晚102、B最早104，安全間隙104−102=2秒；演算法檢查區間而非相減名義時間107−100。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Use the lower endpoint of a two-sided 95% Wilson interval with z=1.96; correlated repeats violate the independent-trial interpretation. Every quantity, event and system state below is original synthetic teaching data. Work only on local files or an explicitly authorized isolated lab, without production access or other people’s data. The baseline has eighteen successes in twenty independent synthetic trials; the larger sample has 180 successes in 200 trials. The lower endpoint is [p̂+z²/(2n)−z√(p̂(1−p̂)/n+z²/(4n²))]/[1+z²/n]; n=20 gives 69.896179%.","RFC 3339 specifies timestamp representation. Bounded clock error is an explicit teaching assumption here; converting a string to UTC removes neither clock offset nor uncertainty, and sorting alone cannot establish causation. Every quantity, event and system state below is original synthetic teaching data. Work only on local files or an explicitly authorized isolated lab, without production access or other people’s data. Event A has nominal time 100 seconds with a ±2-second bound; B has time 107 with ±3 seconds. Preserve raw_time, normalized_time, bound, clock_source and an original-row hash in CSV. A can occur as late as 102; B can occur as early as 104. The guaranteed separation is 104−102=2 seconds. Compare intervals rather than simply subtracting nominal timestamps.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"security-v27-080","referenceUrls":["https://docs.oasis-open.org/cti/taxii/v2.1/os/taxii-v2.1-os.html"],"title":"OASIS TAXII 2.1：分頁游標、版本去重與持久水位","titleEn":"OASIS TAXII 2.1: pagination cursors, version deduplication and durable watermarks","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付20及200筆結果、公式重算、獨立性聲明和重複資料反例；不推論未抽樣的攻擊或環境。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver both outcome tables, formula checks, independence assumptions and duplicated-data counterexamples, without extrapolating to unsampled attacks or environments.","difference":"在本機回放TAXII風格分頁封套，分離伺服器next游標、接收進度與持久提交水位，只有完整落盤成功後才更新同步檢查點。","differenceEn":"Replay local TAXII-style page envelopes, separating the server next cursor, receive progress and durable commit watermark. Advance synchronization checkpoints only after the corresponding page has been completely and successfully persisted.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["使用雙側95%Wilson區間下端，z=1.96；獨立同分布假設若不成立，不能把重複樣本當更多資訊。 本課所有數值、事件與系統狀態均為原創合成資料；只在本機檔案與授權隔離練習中處理，不接觸生產設備或他人資料。 基準20次獨立合成測試成功18次，p̂=0.9；改變樣本為200次成功180次，比例相同。 下端=[p̂+z²/(2n)−z√(p̂(1−p̂)/n+z²/(4n²))]/[1+z²/n]；n=20得到69.896179%。","TAXII 2.1以分頁與篩選傳輸STIX內容；游標是服務端續取資訊，不應自行解碼猜測。用物件ID加版本識別去重，單ID不可吞掉新版本。 本課所有數值、事件與系統狀態均為原創合成資料；只在本機檔案與授權隔離練習中處理，不接觸生產設備或他人資料。 第一頁40個版本鍵、第二頁35個，其中5個與第一頁重複；第三頁25個且都新。重試時額外重送第一頁40列。 唯一版本40+35−5+25=95；正常頁面100列，加重試共140列，重複45列，重複比例45/140=32.142857%。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Use the lower endpoint of a two-sided 95% Wilson interval with z=1.96; correlated repeats violate the independent-trial interpretation. Every quantity, event and system state below is original synthetic teaching data. Work only on local files or an explicitly authorized isolated lab, without production access or other people’s data. The baseline has eighteen successes in twenty independent synthetic trials; the larger sample has 180 successes in 200 trials. The lower endpoint is [p̂+z²/(2n)−z√(p̂(1−p̂)/n+z²/(4n²))]/[1+z²/n]; n=20 gives 69.896179%.","TAXII 2.1 transports STIX content using filtering and pagination. Treat continuation cursors as server-issued information rather than guessing their encoding. Deduplicate object-version identities, not IDs alone, so genuine updates survive. Every quantity, event and system state below is original synthetic teaching data. Work only on local files or an explicitly authorized isolated lab, without production access or other people’s data. Page one has forty version keys; page two has thirty-five including five already on page one. Page three has twenty-five new keys. A retry additionally replays all forty rows from page one. There are 40+35−5+25=95 unique versions. Normal pages contain 100 rows; the retry raises received rows to 140, of which forty-five are duplicates, giving 32.142857%.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-216d7f3ece0be282","url":"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc3339","title":"RFC 3339: Date and Time on the Internet","titleEn":"RFC 3339: Date and Time on the Internet","publisher":"RFC Editor","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-89271334a43be25b","url":"https://docs.oasis-open.org/cti/taxii/v2.1/os/taxii-v2.1-os.html","title":"TAXII Version 2.1 OASIS Standard","titleEn":"TAXII Version 2.1 OASIS Standard","publisher":"OASIS","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
